<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷三射集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 13:26:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>霸治法：论大渴 大吐 大泻 大满 发背痈肿</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 13:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“霸治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;大吐、大泻、大满、大渴、发背痈肿&lt;/strong&gt;等危重急症的峻猛治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病至危殆，死亡顷刻，不可用王道缓图，必以大剂攻邪逐毒之药，单刀直进，摧荡扫除&lt;/strong&gt;，方能力挽狂澜。</description></item><item><title>王治法：论饮食难消 内伤诸症</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-1-wangzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 08:20:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-1-wangzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“王治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;病后体虚、饮食难消、内伤杂症&lt;/strong&gt;的缓调法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;王道荡荡，平补缓调&lt;/strong&gt;。对于大病初愈或内伤虚损之证，不可用霸道峻剂，当以六君子汤为基础，随症加减，徐徐图功。</description></item></channel></rss>